OL,3,AMan found guilty of murdering estranged
OL,4,Awife
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering his estranged wife after he
OL,8,Ftracked her down on a night out.
OL,10,FRaymond Williams, 61, went from venue
OL,11,Fto venue trying to find Tania Williams
OL,12,Fwhile she was out with friends in
OL,13,FNorwich on 17 January.
OL,15,FLater that night, the 49-year-old
OL,16,Fmother of four was found with severe
OL,17,Fwounds to her neck near her home in
OL,18,FCatherine Gardens, Thorpe St Andrew.
OL,19,FShe died of blood loss at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
